{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"A camp? there are camps? tell me where, tell me anything, a rumor, a map, a direction","Heard of a place with a wall and guards... sign says NO ENTRY, so, yeah, no entry","There's a settlement a few miles north, I think, I heard from a man, he didn't look well","I don't know, I haven't seen any, but I haven't looked, I've been too scared","Somebody said there's a safe place at the old mill, with a fence, and a flag, and cooking smells"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Few camps, few walls, few places that aren't one bad night from falling","You can find one if you follow the smoke... but be careful which smoke","Camps want something, labor, loyalty, supplies, so know what you'll give","Trade camp at the crossroads, they take bullets, medicine, and gossip","There's a settlement with real walls... but they're picky -- and they ask hard questions"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I can take you to ours, if you want to see, but you'd have to leave your weapons at the door, ha","There's talk of a safe place north of here, run by some deputies, I'd love to believe it","People mention one in every town, but I've never seen one with my own eyes"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Camps? none that I'd tell you about","Go find your own, or build one!","If I knew, I'd go there myself, wouldn't I?"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=militia",{"We're a post, not a camp, and we don't take refugees, but there's a camp a few miles east.."}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=rescue_clergy",{"The parish hall takes in anyone, but we're nearly full"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Settlements? Walls? Yeah, there's one, and it's got my name on it","A camp with guards and a fence? Sure, I've seen them, and I've robbed two","Why, you want a safe place? No such thing, {g:pal|lady}","If it has a wall, it has a gate, and if it has a gate, it has someone who'll shoot you at it","There's rumors of a big camp up north, with food and showers, I laughed when I heard"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Settlements? There's one here, and you're not welcome!"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I heard of a place, a farm with real walls, they take in anyone who can work, I'm thinking about it"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Camps? Like with tents? Nah, we stay in our own turf","Some folks built a barricade around the school, they let people in for food","Safe camps are traps, they take your stuff and make you work"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Camps are for cowards!"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Heard there's one near the stadium, with soup, I might check it out"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"There's a compound out past the county line, bikers and families, I think they take strangers","Camps tend to fall apart, {g:brother|sister}, someone always gets bit","Clubhouse is home, not a camp, and it's built like a bunker"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=club|st=hostile",{"You're not welcome at ours!"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I could vouch for you at the compound, if you're serious"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Several settlements exist, with varying degrees of hospitality","I could recommend one, though the introduction would cost"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"There's a decent place, well managed, I'll write you a note"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Camp? No, no, they'd ask for papers, they'd find out who I am","I'd love a camp, with a roof, and soup, and a guard to watch the night"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Stay away from camps, they're traps!"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Please, if you find one, tell me, I'll follow you anywhere"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Few and far between, and every one of them suspicious of strangers","I've seen smoke from one near the ridge, I never went close"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I know a family with a stockade, they're good people, they'd let you in"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"The courthouse is the closest thing we have to an official shelter","We're coordinating with other groups, but nothing formal","Several communities have formed, I can give you a list of the ones we trust","I won't call a place secure without knowing who's holding it"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Unregistered settlements are not authorized"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Come with me, I'll introduce you to the group at the courthouse"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Official evacuation points have not been established","There's a staging area at the base, but it's restricted"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Unauthorized camps will be dispersed"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I'd love to point you somewhere safe, friend, I really would"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I heard the base has a camp, but they won't let us go there, I don't understand"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Our township is the nearest, we take in those who can work and follow rules","There's a stockade at the Fisher place, twenty families, strong walls"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come with us, friend, we've room for those who need it"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"Even if I knew where, I'd keep my mouth shut"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"We're setting up a few, but they're temporary, and not open to just anyone","There's one, I can't say where, but we're always looking for good people"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"Classified, move along"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Unknown, but I'll note your interest"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"There's a place, run by folks who don't ask questions, I like it there"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"You think I'd tell you? Ha"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"There's talk, nothing official"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Can't confirm"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Look for the biggest fence, and a lot of guns"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"You'll get no outpost from me"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"Move on, that location is need-to-know and you don't need to"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Plenty of places, none for you"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't give you a confirmed outpost location"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","st=careful",{"I don't hand out other people's hiding places"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","st=hostile",{"You're not being invited anywhere"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I like the sound of somewhere organized, doesn't mean I know where one is"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=military,swat,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No position disclosure to an unknown civilian"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd want a confirmed welcome before sending someone toward armed guards"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=worker|st=neutral,friendly|world=door",{"Putting up boards is easier than deciding who gets through the door"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=club,prison,outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"You wouldn't give me the address of everybody you care about - same goes here"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=raider,crime,gang|st=careful,hostile",{"Keep asking where people sleep, see how friendly that makes them"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|world=generator",{"There's people in a walled yard somewhere, I heard a generator and I walked the other way"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly|world=building",{"We're it, four grown, two kids, a block wall and a dog scared of everything"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=door,fence",{"Anybody with a fence and a plan keeps a list on the door - get your name on a list"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly|world=door",{"Firehouse is holding, big doors, a well, and a hundred feet of hose that's no use now"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|world=door",{"No wall to speak of, we're just sitting in a church with the doors shut"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Laundry hanging on a line means they've got water to spare"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=family_elder|st=friendly|world=building",{"This porch is my outpost, been on it since the fourth and I ain't lost it yet"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Find the one with a nurse in it, walls are easy, people who can stitch ain't"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"There's a couple places holding, I won't say where, you'd do the same in my boots"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"Everything organized in this county got that way 'cause one hard person made it so"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Any position worth the name has two exits and somebody awake - ask about both"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"We were a checkpoint, then we were four guys and a truck - now I don't know what we are"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Positions change hands, anything I gave you would be three days old and dangerous"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=club|st=neutral|world=door",{"Club's got a shop with a roll door - it's ours, you'd know it if you weren't welcome"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"There's a place takes anybody who brings goods, I wouldn't describe it as safe"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=mercenary|st=neutral",{"Three places hiring, two pay in food, one pays in promises, guess which one's bigger"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"A gate that swings out beats one that swings in - look at the hinges before you walk in"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=family,civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"A settlement's just people who agreed on rules, so ask what the rules are first"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"I'm not telling a stranger where people sleep - ask me anything else - please"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"I stay away from them, a camp's a bell that rings for miles"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=law_trooper|st=careful",{"I'd want to know who's holding a place before I told anybody it was there"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=swat|st=careful|world=road",{"Negative on locations, if they want you, they'll find you on the road"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=deserter|st=careful",{"There's a cordon post that looks like a settlement from a distance - don't make that mistake"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=militia|st=careful",{"You're standing at one - Wanda reads the list and you ain't on the list yet"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=sad",{"We got turned away from one, they were real nice about it, that's the part that sits on me"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile,neutral",{"There's a nice one about four mile out, we're going Thursday - you in or out?"},false,{[1]="HELP_THEM"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"The block's the only settlement that counts and you're stood on the edge of it"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","role=raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"I know every walled place in this county, that's my work, yours is walking away"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile|world=building",{"A wall's a wall, I don't much care which side they tell me I'm on"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=hostile|world=door",{"I asked that same question at three doors - go find out what that's like"}},
{"ASK_OUTPOST","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile",{"Every place that was organized in June is a story people tell now - think on that"}},
{"ASK_PETS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"A dog, a mutt, named Biscuit, he's- he was, I don't know, I had to leave him, I had to leave him!","A cat, an orange tabby, she hated everybody, but she liked me, and I miss her so, so much","Had a beagle, he followed me for three days, then he went off after a squirrel, and I hope he's alive","A parakeet, believe it or not, I let it go, it was the only thing I could do","Two dogs, a Lab and a shepherd, they're my security system, they bark if anyone gets close","A horse, an old gelding, he's in the pasture, the grass is still green, I check on him","No pets, I couldn't keep a goldfish alive, thank God I never had a dog, I'd have killed him","Dog, he's my family, he's lying right over there, he doesn't talk, but he's smart","Saw a stray the other day... a skinny little thing, I left a can of tuna, I don't know why, it just felt right","Chickens, six of 'em, they're alive, they're eating bugs, and laying eggs, it's the one good thing","I had a dog named Boone","There was a cat, an orange one, who ruled the porch","My horse is the reason I'm alive","A parrot, can you believe that","I've got a pair of beagles..","The kids' hamster died on the second day","A stray followed me home","No pets, never had any","My old hound sleeps at my feet","We had chickens","A goat","Two cats, a dog, and a rabbit","My dog wouldn't leave the porch","Her name's Peaches"},false,false,{[11]={{t="he was a good boy, a fool, and the best listener I ever had",afterMs=3500},{t="I left the gate open",afterMs=3000}},[12]={{t="I looked for her for two days",afterMs=3200},{t="I still leave out a saucer",afterMs=2800}},[13]={{t="she carried me out",afterMs=3500},{t="she's grazing now, thank God",afterMs=3000}},[14]={{t="he mimics the smoke detector",afterMs=3200},{t="scared the dickens out of me at four in the morning",afterMs=2800}},[15]={{t="they bark at nothing, and I've learned to listen",afterMs=3500},{t="nothing is never nothing...",afterMs=3000}},[16]={{t="we had a funeral in a shoebox",afterMs=3200},{t="it was the first time they cried",afterMs=2800}},[17]={{t="skinny thing, one ear",afterMs=3500},{t="I named him Lucky",afterMs=3000},{t="I don't know why",afterMs=2800}},[18]={{t="but I find myself talking to a crow",afterMs=3200}},[19]={{t="he's deaf now",afterMs=3500},{t="but he knows when something's wrong",afterMs=3000}},[20]={{t="the foxes got the last one",afterMs=3200},{t="I cried over a chicken",afterMs=2800}},[21]={{t="she eats everything, including my hat",afterMs=3500}},[22]={{t="it's a zoo, and I wouldn't change it",afterMs=3200}},[23]={{t="I called and called",afterMs=3500},{t="I had to go, I had to",afterMs=3000}},[24]={{t="she's a mutt",afterMs=3200},{t="she's the bravest of us all",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_PETS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you after my dog?","My pets are my own business","Why do you ask?","Keep any animal away from me, dogs bark, barking brings them, I'm not dying over somebody's pet"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hound named Duke, best friend I ever had, best partner, never lied to me once"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"A cat named Mittens, thirteen years, she sits in my lap and doesn't care that the world ended"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"My dog is the best dog in the whole world, I won't leave without him, I don't care what anyone says"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"The kids are devastated about the cat, we left her at the neighbor's, and I tell them she's fine"}},
{"ASK_PETS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"A cat who thinks she's a dog, and a dog who thinks he's a cat","I named my goldfish Bruce"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm just the can opener",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="he outlived my marriage",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_PETS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Want to meet her?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="she's friendly, mostly",afterMs=3200}}}},
