{"ASK_PETS","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,family_woman,civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My daughter's hamster is in a shoebox in my bag - I know how that sounds, it's the one thing she asked me to save"}},
