{"ASK_PETS","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had a coonhound named Judge, best thing about me, folks said - they weren't wrong about that","Got a pen of chickens out back of a place I know - pets? Hell no - that's breakfast"}},
