{"ASK_PETS","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Dogs are doing fine, better than us, they worked out to travel in threes"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I miss having a dog. I'd feel better with one around, though I know that wouldn't solve everything"}},
{"ASK_PETS","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|mood=sad|world=door",{"Somebody's pointer sits at the church door every morning, waiting on his man"}},
