{"ASK_PETS","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=sad",{"The kids keep asking about the cat... I keep saying she's at the neighbor's"}},
{"ASK_PETS","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Dogs bark, barking tells me where a house is - so I got no problem with dogs"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plan? I don't have a plan, I have a list of things not to do, does that count?","Stay alive -- find my family, avoid the dead, that's it, that's the plan, three steps","Wait for the Army, they said they'd come, I'm giving them till the end of the week","G-get to higher ground, that's all I've got, higher ground and a prayer!","Honestly? I'm making it up as I go -- which is terrifying, but here we are","Find water, find a bed, and if I run into an actual person, that's a bonus","I'm planning not to panic, and I'm failing, but I'm planning it hard","Make it to morning, then do the whole thing AGAIN","I want to go home -- take a long bath, and pretend none of this happened, how's that for a plan"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Keep the group fed... keep the group quiet, keep the group alive, repeat..","Dig in... make a wall, make a garden, make a life, the dead can walk around it","Winter's coming, so we gather wood now, and we put up what food we can","Shore up the barricade, count the cans, check the watch, I could do it in my sleep","We're looking for someplace better than this... but not too far, so we stay","We don't plan anymore, we just try not to die today, and then tomorrow we do it again","Wait for rain, we're low on water, and everything depends on a cloud"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"Why would I tell you my plan?","My plans are my own","Funny -- I was gonna ask you the same thing!","None of your business -- and I'd move along if I were you"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=civilian_loner",{"Find a quiet spot, wait it out, they'll thin, they always do, one way or another","Check my snares, eat what I find, sleep when I can, no plan beyond tomorrow","Hunt, trade, stay out of sight, no big mystery","Wait for the cold, the cold will slow 'em, and then I'll move...","Same thing I do every day, put one foot in front of the other and see what the road says","I got a little cabin, I'd like to get to it before dark, that's the plan, that's all","Fish when I can... trade jerky for tobacco, drift when the town gets too loud"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"My plan is to be left alone, so, you see the problem","Nothing you need to know, partner"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Get the kids somewhere safe, that's the plan, the only plan, the whole plan","Mostly we try to stay together and not make a sound, Mama makes us say it every morning","We're gonna ride it out, we've got food for a week, and then we reassess","Keep the baby fed, keep the baby warm, and God help me, keep the baby QUIET","We have a list, taped to the fridge, in my daughter's handwriting, it says \"BE BRAVE\"","I want to get to the farm, it's only fifteen miles, but fifteen miles is a lifetime now"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_elder",{"Plan? honey, at my age the plan is to wake up, I'm doing well so far","Sit here, rock, wait, my son said he'd come, so I'll wait","Pray, mostly, and keep the kettle on, that's about it"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_youth",{"I don't know, honestly, figure it out, my brain is like static right now","Find my parents, then I guess go from there, that's all I've got","Don't get noticed, and if I do, I run like hell"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=worker",{"Feed the crew, get 'em a bed, get 'em home in one piece, every single day","Fix what's broken... and in this world everything's broken -- so I'm gonna be busy","Wait for the power to come back on... and then I'll know it's over, until then, we hold","Haul water, patch walls, mind my business, I'm not complicated"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_medical",{"Keep people breathing and the infection from spreading... and my hands from shaking","Find antibiotics, and don't ask how, because the answer is probably illegal","Triage, sleep, triage, sleep, repeat, that's the schedule","Help whoever walks through the door... even if they don't deserve it, that's the oath, the real one"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_clergy",{"Sit with the dying, bury the ones we lose, and hang on to my faith best I can","Keep the doors open, keep the pot full, keep the candles lit, and pray for the rest","Hold services on Sunday, even if it's only three people, even if it's only me"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Check the houses on my route... pull out whoever's still breathing, put out whatever's still burning","Keep the station running, keep the crew fed, keep the radio on, and hope someone answers","Stay ready, that's the job, you don't know when the bell rings, so you're always ready"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=militia",{"Hold the line, keep the road clear, protect the families, that's about all","Swap watches, pass on what we hear, keep the powder dry, nobody plays hero","Wait for orders, even if no one's coming, I'm not going to be the one who quits"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Come with us and find out, you're part of the plan now, whether you like it or not","We could use your thoughts on it, you're sharp, I'd like your opinion","You first, what would YOU do? I trust your judgment more than mine","Stay alive, find more people like you, build something good out of the wreckage","I'd like to rebuild, slowly, a little at a time, with friends","Plant a garden, and hope the rain holds, and invite you to dinner","Same as always: look after my own, and the people who look after us","Get through winter, that's the first goal, and the second, and the third","Find a place with a well, and a stove, and a roof that doesn't leak!","Honestly? Keep the lights on and not lose my mind","I wanna build a real settlement, with rules and everything","Teach the kids to read, and teach the grown-ups to listen!!","Find the others, bring them in, make a place worth protecting, ha","I'd like to write down everything we've learned, so someone else won't have to learn it twice","Set up a watch, a market, a clinic, a school, step by step","Dream big, and work small, that's my motto!","Whatever we do, we do it together, with you if you'll have us","I want to find my daughter, and then, who knows!!","Keep walking, keep helping, keep believing, that's my whole plan","I'll let you in on a secret: I'm building a boat","We're putting in a fence, a real one, with a gate that rings a bell","Make peace with the neighbors -- and share the harvest","I plan to see the end of this, and then to plant an apple tree!!","Right now? Survive -- huh, maybe I should think bigger though","If we can hold out until the first frost, we might just make it","Practical stuff, mostly: water, food, shelter, and good company","Save what we can, share what we have, and hold on to each other","Remember who we are, no matter what","I'm still working on it, and I'd love your advice","Find the rest of my family, and then go from there","Open a school in the church basement, if the church will have us","We're collecting seeds, and hope, and hoping they sprout","Help you, if you need it, and let you help me","Breakfast, then lunch, then pray there's dinner"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Nothing that includes you","My plan is to stay far from the likes of you"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|rep=bad,worst",{"Get lost, my plans aren't your business"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"My plans don't include you","Staying away from you, for starters","My plans are none of yours, friend","Why do you want to know? To get in my way?","I plan on seeing the BACK of you","Oh, you'll hear about my plans when they're done, along with EVERYONE else","Not sharing, not now, not with you","To get through the day without trouble, and so far, it hasn't been working","Same as always, minding my business, which you could try","My plan is to ignore you until you go away","Survive -- which is going fine, until you showed up","I plan to be ready if you try anything","Stay away from your type","I'd tell you, but you'd use it","To find a way out of this county, AWAY from you!","You'll be the first to know, after everyone else","My plan is none of your concern","Plans? Mine stay with me","I'm going to wait you out","The less you know, the better for everyone","It's a small plan, and you're not in it","Let me think... nope, still not telling you","I plan to forget this conversation ever happened","Don't make plans around me","To be left alone, thank you very much","I'm not obliged to tell you","My plan is to go on living, no thanks to you","It's called \"minding my own business,\" look it up","You'll find out when it's too late -- or never!","Nothing you'd approve of, probably","I have NO plans for you, and that's the plan!"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst|hour=16,5",{"I plan to lock the door tonight, and you won't be on the other side"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Plan? Run! That's the plan! Run!","Right now? Survive the next five minutes","Hide, wait, hope, repeat","Get away from THAT, then think","New plan, same as the old plan: live"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Have you got a plan? you look like someone who does"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Wait it out","Stay home and wait for somebody to come tell us what to do"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's the plan",afterMs=3500},{t="they'll fix it...",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="like they said on TV",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"Figure out where to go","Gather supplies, find allies, avoid trouble"},false,false,{[1]={{t="and how to get there",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"Build something that lasts","Plan for winter..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="a wall, maybe a garden, some kind of routine",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="it's coming",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Make it to morning","Sleep -- if I'm lucky...","Staying awake, mostly -- and quiet about it"},false,false,{[1]={{t="that's the plan, right now",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="sit up with the bat, if I'm not",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,10",{"Breakfast, a look around, a plan for the day","See how the neighbors are, run the traps, that's about it"},false,false,{[1]={{t="in that order",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=11,18",{"Water, shade, lunch if I'm lucky","Make it to evening in one piece.."}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"Get inside, bar the door, count the cans","Cook what we have, before the light goes"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Plans? I don't make plans, plans make me nervous","Hide... I guess, hide and hope"},false,false,{[2]={{t="that's all I've got",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I used to have plans..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="a wedding, a house, a vacation",afterMs=3500},{t="they're in a drawer",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Get even, that's my plan"},false,false,{[1]={{t="get even, then get the hell out",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Build a life again"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a small one, with friends in it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"My plan is to have a plan by Tuesday"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"My plan is to take what I need and not get shot doing it, you got a better one?","Plan? Eat, drink, not die... and now I guess answer a nosy stranger","What am I doing? Minding my own business, which you're wandering into","Looking for things that belong to me, I just don't know who has them yet","Same as every day- find stuff, take it, keep it","I could tell you but then you'd tell somebody, and then I'd have to find them","Waiting on a friend who's late, and I'm in a mood about it","Working, {g:pal|lady}, you're standing in the middle of my workday"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Plan is you stop asking, and if that doesn't work, I improvise","What am I doing? Deciding whether you're worth the bullet"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? Just trying to eat and not die, same as everybody, you hungry too?","Scouting a little, nothing fancy, there's a lot of stuff just lying around out here"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Plans are mine, I don't share them, you'll find out when it's too late to matter"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Handling business on our block, that's it, that's the plan","Making sure nobody steps on us, you steppin'?","Waiting on word from the big homie, till then, I'm just here","Eating, sleeping, watching the corner, that's a plan, ain't it?","Doing what I always do, protecting what's ours"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Plan is you walk away, now, or the plan changes"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Chilling, mostly, it's been a long couple days, you good?"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Waiting on orders from the president, till then we sit tight","Watching the road for brothers who ain't back yet, and I'm worried sick","I take what the club needs, it's in the bylaws, kind of","Nothing you've been invited to, friend","Hold what's ours and keep our people alive, that's all the plan there is"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Honest answer? No clue, {g:man|lady}, lots of coffee and we'll see"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Just business, and you're not in it","My plans are mine, but I'll tell you this much, they don't involve a crowd","Collecting what I'm owed, in a world where debts don't mean much","Assessing, that's all, it's a good habit","Just waiting for the right moment, and so far this isn't it"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Rebuilding, if you can believe it, the world needs people who can arrange things"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Plan? I don't-- there's no plan, I just walk, I keep walking","Stay out of sight, out of reach... and out of a cell, that's it","I want to see the sky without wire in front of it, that's all I've got","Find food, find a place with one way in, and not die, go ahead and laugh"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"My plan is to stay free, you getting in the way of it?!"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Honest? Just eat something hot and sleep without someone watching, that's my dream"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Staying alive, then tomorrow, staying alive again, it's a short plan","Hunting what I can and avoiding the rest, you'd call that a plan","Looking for a quiet place to wait this out, haven't found one yet","Moving at my own pace, not following anyone's rules but mine"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Same as you, I bet, find something to eat and a spot to rest, why, got ideas?"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Keeping my head down and my hands clean, that's it","Go as far from the Army as I can, and then keep going"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Maintaining order, such as it is","We're checking the area, trying to keep people safe","Responding to calls that don't come in anymore, and doing it anyway","I'm doing my job, even if nobody's paying me to anymore","Patrolling, that's all, same as always"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law|st=hostile",{"My plans are not your concern, your plans on the other hand, I'd like to hear"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Helping folks where I can, you need something?","Looking for survivors who need help, you hurt? You need water?"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Holding this county together with spit and wire, and I'm running out of both"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_trooper|st=neutral,careful",{"Get people to the Louisville line if there's still a way through, that's the plan"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_sergeant|st=neutral,careful",{"Keep my deputies alive, everything else comes after that"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_corrections|st=neutral,careful",{"Make sure no one from the facility gets near regular folks, that's what's left of my job"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=swat|st=neutral,careful",{"Sweep and secure, that's all you need"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Awaiting orders, that's the plan until someone gives me a new one","Maintaining a security perimeter, we've been told to hold","Escorting supplies, nothing you'd find interesting"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That's not your concern, move along"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Trying to find survivors and get them somewhere safe, are you hurt?"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"I follow orders and I keep my people breathing, there's not much else to a plan"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Um, wait, I think-- I'm supposed to hold this position, that's what the Sergeant said","Honestly? Don't know, I just follow the others and try not to throw up"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Mission-specific, you're not cleared"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Complete the contract, collect the money, assuming anyone's alive to pay it"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Watching the road, making sure no strangers walk into our families","Same thing we've been doing since this started, protecting our own","Keeping the farm safe, and my kids alive, that's the plan"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=militia|st=hostile",{"Plan is you leave, before we have to make a different one"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Just trying to keep my neighbors fed and alive, we could use more help if you're willing"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plans? I don't have plans, I have a series of hopes, mostly about breakfast","Keep moving, stay quiet, find food... that's the plan, honestly","I want to find my sister, that's all, I have to know she's alive","Honestly? Survive today, then figure out tomorrow"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Eat, sleep, hide, repeat, ha, I wish it was funnier","Head north, find the Army, or at least find someone with a map","Stay low, stay quiet, let the dust settle, then see who's left","Fix this place up, make it livable, make it ours"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"My plans? I keep those close, you understand","Why, you want in on my plan? Get your own"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Keep the family together, that's the only plan I have, dear","Pray, mostly, and then pray some more"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Protect who we can, keep order, wait for backup","Hold the line until someone relieves us"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"I can't discuss plans, even with the friendly ones"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hold position, await orders","Keep watch, and let each other know before you go anywhere"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"Need to know only"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Make money, break things, drink, in whichever order","Take what we need, burn what we don't"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Plans? Heh, I plan to shoot anyone who asks me questions"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Survive"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","st=friendly,neutral",{"Make a small plan I can actually keep. Start there","I'd like to get through a day without changing my mind out of fear","Nothing grand. I don't want to sell you a dream I can't carry myself","I'm still working out what I need and what I just miss","Find a reason to think a little further ahead. I haven't got there yet","I keep making big decisions when I'm tired. I'd like to stop doing that","Don't know. I wish saying it bothered me less","Keep my promises small enough to mean something"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","st=neutral,careful",{"I'd prefer to know you better before I talk about where I'm going"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"First I want a quiet minute to think. Then I'll have a better answer"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,20",{"Plan? Wait for the Army, I guess, they have to come eventually - right?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Get to my mother's in Brandenburg, after that I don't have a plan, after that is too far"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Find diapers, same as yesterday, same as tomorrow"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_man|st=friendly,neutral",{"Keep the kids fed until somebody official tells us what's going on"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral|world=water",{"My dad says we're heading for the river, he says it like he knows - I don't think he knows"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"I'm going to sit on this porch and outlive every last one of those things"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Today? Water - tomorrow? Also water, plan gets real simple once your well goes bad"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=neutral",{"Board up the back of the house before the next bunch comes through - then sleep"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly|world=water",{"Checking snares down on the creek, could use another set of eyes - you walking that way?"},false,{[1]="WALK_TOGETHER"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Clear the houses on Oak Street one at a time - slow is how you keep all your fingers"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=generator",{"Get the generator at the water plant running, then everybody gets showers, then I'm a hero"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"If we're clearing bodies, we need a plan. Nobody likes that job, but rushing it won't help"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Find insulin, there's a diabetic boy at our place, and his mom's been counting pens"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Tonight I bury Mrs. Hollis beside her husband like she asked - tomorrow, whoever needs me"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=careful",{"My plans are my business"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"I'm just, going - please don't follow me, okay?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"My plan is for you to walk away, let's start there - you doing that?"},false,{[1]="LEAVE_NOW"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_deputy,law_officer,law_trooper,law_corrections|st=friendly,neutral",{"Keep the peace, what there is of it, check on the folks who didn't evacuate"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hold this town until the state gets its act together - or until we can't"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"My plan involves you keeping your distance, that's step one"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"Plan is you get cuffed, anything else, you're choosing to make it worse"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Clearing a structure, you'll want to be elsewhere"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=7,18",{"Checkpoint duty, standing in the sun telling people they can't leave - Riveting"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Hold the road, keep the line, get my people home - in that order, until it changes"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I think we hold here until relieved, nobody's said who's relieving us"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"Our operations are classified, your plan should be leaving"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Mission's ongoing"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Your plan is to walk the other way"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Be three counties over before anybody official figures out where I went"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=deserter|st=friendly,neutral|world=fence,water",{"Get across the river before they finish the fence, then, I don't know - anywhere"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=outlaw|st=careful,hostile",{"My plans don't include you, let's keep it that way"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plan's easy - find people with stuff - get stuff, you're sorta on the list right now"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","role=raider_boss|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hit the pharmacy in {town} before the church people strip it - then the gun shop"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Holding the block, anybody wants through, they pay the toll"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Run up the Dixie, see what's still standing, take what's left - drink the rest"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Plan? I spent seven years with nothing but a plan - now I'm just enjoying the weather"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=careful",{"Our plans are ours - keep walking or end up part of them"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=hostile",{"Plan's to see what you got in that bag, unless you'd like to make it easy"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Buy low - sell high, the low has never been lower"}},
{"ASK_PLANS","reg=crime|st=careful,hostile",{"The plan doesn't change because you asked about it, your situation might"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"The police left on the third, haven't seen a patrol since"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"A deputy came by early on, he told us to stay inside, that was it"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"The station on Main is empty, door's wide open - looks like they ran"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Deputies come by now and then, they help where they can"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"We're what's left, a few of us still hold the line"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Law is what we make of it now"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Local law enforcement has been integrated into our command","Local law got folded into the cordon or they're gone - mostly gone"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not relevant"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"The police? Hah - good riddance"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Cops? They're lunch"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Pigs are gone - block's ours","Cops ran first chance they got - we stayed - so who's protecting who now?"},false,{[2]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"No more cops, no more tickets - I admit I enjoy it","Last trooper who pulled us over is still sitting in his cruiser on 31W - he's not writing tickets anymore"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Law is a negotiation, and one side left the table","No cops means no rules, and no rules means business is booming - you buying, or just asking?"},false,{[2]="TRADE_OFFER"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Cops? The only ones I know ran off","Guards at the prison got the call, locked the gate and ran - nobody was coming back to count heads"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"T-the deputies? gone -- I think, or dead, or home with their families, I called the sheriff and got a busy signal","There was a cruiser at the corner -- lights on, nobody in it, door open, I didn't go closer","They were the first to go down -- they ran toward it, because that's their job, and now they're gone","Someone said there's a police station still operating, but I couldn't find it, and I looked!","I saw an officer yesterday, he was walking, just walking, and he didn't have a face anymore","I'd love to find a cop, I'd hug him, I'd give him all my cans, I just want to see ONE","N-no police, no ambulance, no fire truck, NOBODY, I guess that's what \"alone\" means"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"A few still hang around the station, but they ain't police no more, just another bunch with guns","Police are people too, and people break, and I saw a couple of them break","The sheriff's office held out longest, then ran out of ammo, and ran out of men","Some of 'em turned bad, took over a store, a block, a street, and call it law, don't trust a badge out here","There was a deputy named Walker, he was good, he died on the third day, shielding a woman and her kids","The police scanner went silent in the first week, that's how I knew"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Police are saying stay indoors, they're stretched thin, there's an overflow of calls","I called 911 and a woman said \"all lines are busy,\" then the line went dead, and I don't think she was a recording"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Police? Why -- you wanted by them?","What would I tell the cops? that I met you? NO thanks","Don't mention the police to me","Police? What police?","I don't talk about cops","You want police? Looking to turn somebody in? Keep your distance while you explain"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=militia",{"Sheriff's department set up a roadblock, and then abandoned it, I assume they had a reason","We cooperate with the sheriff, what's left of him, we share radios and rumors"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=rescue_medical",{"I treated a deputy with a bite, he asked me to shoot him before he turned, I couldn't, someone else did","Police still bring us the wounded, bringing them in, hoping for a miracle, I don't have any"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=civilian_loner",{"Police were never my friends, but I'd shake a deputy's hand right now","Saw a squad car stuck in the ditch, radio still crackling, nobody to answer"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"We backed up the cops on every call, fought side by side, I miss that"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Officer Dunn came to the church, he wanted prayers, I gave him every one I had, he went back out"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"The sheriff's office had a roadblock at the junction","A deputy gave me a ride once, early on","I called 911, and a woman answered","There was a patrol car in the ditch, lights still flashing","The police I knew are gone","I saw an officer shoot a friend of mine","They tried to hold order","Cops are just people","A trooper stopped by yesterday","I'd love to see a badge right now"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I haven't seen it since the fourth",afterMs=3500},{t="I hope they went home",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="kindest man",afterMs=3200},{t="I never got his name",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="she said, \"I can't help you\"",afterMs=3500},{t="she sounded so tired",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="I didn't look inside",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="or changed",afterMs=3500},{t="I can't tell which is worse",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="the friend had turned",afterMs=3500},{t="the officer wept",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="for about a day",afterMs=3200}},[8]={{t="and people break",afterMs=3500}},[9]={{t="told me to keep my head down",afterMs=3200},{t="I would've anyway",afterMs=3000}},[10]={{t="any badge",afterMs=3500},{t="even a bad one",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"The police are on a donut break","I'd kill for a speeding ticket right now","The only cop I've seen in days was on a donut box, ha"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a very long one",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="a nice, boring ticket",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"If you see one, tell him I said \"thank you\""}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Call the sheriff... they'll know what to do","Police are everywhere, directing traffic, trying to keep order"},false,false,{[1]={{t="oh, wait, the line's busy",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"Police presence is thin now","They were stretched and then they weren't there.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="I haven't seen a cruiser in days",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"There are no police","Cops are a memory..."},false,false,{[1]={{t="there are men with badges who do what they like",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Please tell me you found a cop... please"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"The deputy next door"},false,false,{[1]={{t="good man",afterMs=3500},{t="he turned on his own porch",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Where were the police?! WHERE?! when we called?!"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Cops? There's nobody left to arrest me, not that they ever could","The police station went quiet on day two, nobody's answered since","Cops are either dead or hiding, either way they aren't my problem","A badge doesn't mean a thing now, only guns do","Saw a deputy yesterday, he looked at me, I looked at him, we both decided not to find out","Used to be I had to look over my shoulder for the sheriff, now it's a little more relaxed","Cops, cops, cops... they were useless when it was good and they're worse now"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Cops? I'd love to meet one, it's been too long","You a cop? Say it, say it right now, because I'll know if you're lying"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Saw a patrol car yesterday, it kept on going, didn't even stop, I wanted to yell but I couldn't","I keep hoping a deputy shows up. Me. Look at me"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Police, {g:man|lady}? They fled, left the neighborhood to rot","Cops haven't patrolled here in days, thank God","They sat on their hands when we asked for help, now we don't need them","Funny, the day the cops finally disappeared was the day I actually needed one"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Cops are the enemy, same as always, and you look a little too clean to me"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I heard some deputies are holed up at the courthouse, helping folks, which is weird to say out loud"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"The sheriff's department fell apart on the second day, no more tickets","They're dead, or hiding, or running, take your pick","Funny how I used to hate seeing a squad car, now I'd give anything to see one"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Cops can kiss my ass"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Some of them are decent, I'll give them that, one pulled me out of a ditch once"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Law enforcement is occupied, as are we all","They've lost control, as have we all, I find it almost poetic","Several officers I knew personally have stopped answering their phones, which is to say, their phones no longer ring"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"They are doing what they can, I'd imagine, and I'd imagine it isn't much"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd turn myself in if the cops weren't gone, honestly, but they are","I saw state police on the highway, they didn't stop, I hid in the ditch until they passed","Cops put me in prison, then the prison put me on the street, and I still don't know who to be angry at"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"No cops! Don't mention the cops!"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"If a cop offered me food I'd take it, no questions asked"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Sheriff's deputies are scattered, the station is empty","Saw a trooper a few days back, looked terrified, drove right past me","There was a deputy named Wilkes who never gave me trouble, I hope he's alive"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Good folks, most of them, doing a hard job"}},
{"ASK_POLICE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"They don't care about me and I don't care about them"}},
